\f1\b\fs26 \cf0 Use a SQL database without writing SQL\
\pard\qc\partightenfactor0
\f0\b0\fs22 \cf0 \
This example app shows the \f1\b SQL Generator\f0\b0 , a FutureBasic module included with it. You describe each statement with Cocoa dictionaries and arrays: tables, columns, joins and filters. The SQL Generator writes the SQL for you, parameterized and safe, with every value kept apart from it.\
\
Ten examples run on a small CRM database: SELECT, joins, filters, INSERT (one row or many), UPDATE and DELETE.\
\
\f1\b Help > SQL Generator Example Help\f0\b0  shows how to use it in your own app.\
